GS Graphic Control Panel  6.0d18  Release Notes  Michael SteinNetprinter CDEV  1.0a2BRC #74300  (machine hangs after renaming a printer and starting a new app without closing control panel first.)Eventually traced it down to the fact that an AppleTalk parameter block had a bad pointer and so it wastrashing some memory when you downloaded the emulatorNamer CDEV 1.0a2BRC #74300  (machine hangs after renaming a printer and starting a new app without closing control panel first.)Eventually traced it down to the fact that an AppleTalk parameter block had a bad pointer and so it wastrashing some memory when you renamed a printer.MIDI CDEV 1.0b2Enhanced user interface.